sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant FBAuth as Firebase Auth
    participant Firestore
    participant CloudRun as Cloud Run (Deno)
    participant Worker as Sandbox Worker

    User->>Browser: Open Application
    User->>Browser: Click "Continue with Google"
    Browser->>FBAuth: signInWithPopup()
    FBAuth-->>Browser: Firebase User
    Browser->>Firestore: Create/update user document

    User->>Browser: Click "ADD NEW"
    Browser->>Firestore: Create endpoint document
    Firestore-->>Browser: Endpoint with unique ID
    Browser-->>User: Show webhook URL

    Note over User,Worker: External system sends webhook
    User->>CloudRun: POST /w/{endpointId}
    CloudRun->>CloudRun: Look up endpoint
    CloudRun->>Worker: Execute user script (sandboxed)
    Worker-->>CloudRun: {status, headers, body}
    CloudRun->>CloudRun: Log request + response
    CloudRun-->>User: Scripted HTTP response

    User->>Browser: View endpoint detail
    Browser->>Firestore: Fetch executions
    Firestore-->>Browser: Request logs
    Browser-->>User: Display headers, body, query, response
